== gemini-settings.json (json)
mcpServers.unifi-fabric.env:
  - UNIFI_READ_ONLY
  - UNIFI_ENABLE_MOBILITY_WRITE
  + UNIFI_WRITE_POLICY=deny
  + UNIFI_WRITE_EXCEPTIONS=family:mobility=deny
  # MANUAL: UNIFI_DRY_RUN has a value this script cannot read (a reference or pass-through); see https://github.com/swkstudios/unifi-fabric-mcp-server/blob/v0.7.1/docs/MIGRATING-0.7.1.md
Dry run: nothing written. Run again with --write to save (keeps a .bak copy).
Some settings need a decision (# MANUAL above); see https://github.com/swkstudios/unifi-fabric-mcp-server/blob/v0.7.1/docs/MIGRATING-0.7.1.md
